WEBVTT

NOTE Final Vestige Studios R324. Caption concept for an original 42-second short film.
NOTE No encoded video is present. The timings are production targets, not sync-tested media.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A recording can sound complete even when a syllable has been removed.
In 1970, researchers demonstrated that strange mismatch.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
It shows how expectation shapes hearing.
It does not prove an audio product can reprogram your mind.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Still, a short listening routine might suit you better
than an hour you never schedule.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Try twelve minutes for free.
See whether you prefer a guide, nature sounds, or silence.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 sells short recordings in several styles.
Its stronger benefit promises are the seller's claims, not ours.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Compare the actual package, evidence and limits before deciding.
The free Fieldbook remains available.
